/**
 * Byte-oriented N-Triples/N-Quads parser adapted from Kuzu's bulk parser.
 *
 * <p>
 * The callback receives canonical term bytes directly. Ordinary input therefore does not allocate RDF model objects or
 * Java strings.
 */
